# Lists inside rows keep their elements on refresh (latency.md step 10):
# a hovered button keeps its hover across the minute tick, the on-screen
# keyboard changes labels on Shift without flashing.
look material
setup notify-send -a Files -A open=Open 'Copied' '3 files'
wait 2
ipc panels open notificationCenter IRICE-TEST
wait 1.5
shot nc-open
note find the card's Open button in nc-open; the runner's reviewer moves the pointer there with the next ptr step (adjust X Y)
ptr glide 1700 200 300
wait 1
shot hover-before-tick
wait 70
shot hover-after-tick
note hover-after-tick shows the same hover as hover-before-tick (QML and Rust)
ipc panels close
wait 1
# the on-screen keyboard: Shift twice, recorded
ipc panels open keyboard IRICE-TEST
wait 1.5
shot osk-open
note find Shift in osk-open and adjust the next ptr step
rec osk-shift 1.2 ptr move 120 980 click
rec osk-shift-back 1.2 ptr move 120 980 click
ipc panels close
note the keys change their labels only: no whole-keyboard flash (frames over the keys' area: labels only)
